 *                 equipped comparison with a grade-tinted card built from
 *                 validated Banquet snapshots. Each pane takes its final
 *                 geometry when it opens and shows a loading skeleton until
 *                 its snapshot arrives, so the stock body is never painted
 *                 first. Native item art, the decorated title formatter and
 *                 the stock fallback stay owned by UIItemCollectionWnd. Slot
 *                 19 (OnProcess) drives request spacing and timeouts because
 *                 OnDraw only runs for dirty windows. Inventory/equipment
